  "content": "\n\n<pre>&nbsp;</pre>\n<p><img src=\"https://bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Demon_Slayer_Unleashed/BH_DS_Header.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1123\" height=\"360\"></p>\n<h5 style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</h5>\n<h5 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><a href=\"https://discord.gg/KmjsyQ5QDt\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/846551844095918080?color=blueviolet&label=Discord&logo=Discord&logoColor=blueviolet&style=for-the-badge\" width=\"201\" height=\"27\"></a>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/bePatron?u=55522716\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/endpoint.svg?url=https://shieldsio-patreon.vercel.app/api?username=HungryHippo3460&type=patrons&style=for-the-badge\" width=\"186\" height=\"27\"></a>&nbsp; &nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/HungryHippo3460/projects\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/My-Modpacks-important?style=for-the-badge&logo=curseforge&logoColor=important\" width=\"151\" height=\"27\"></a></strong></h5>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Demon_Slayer_Unleashed/BH_DS_GettingStarted.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1123\" height=\"116\"></p>\n<p>這是一個以戰鬥為核心的整合包，主要圍繞 Orca 開發的《鬼滅之刃》模組打造。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>收集資源，建立你的帝國！</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Demon_Slayer_Unleashed/BH_DS_Team.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1123\" height=\"116\"></p>\n<p><img></p>\n<p>探索這片土地，與惡鬼搏鬥或將人類作為獵物。取得專屬的日輪刀，成為巡邏大地、擊殺所有阻擋去路惡鬼的「鬼殺隊」成員。或者，飲下無慘之血化身為鬼，在荒野中搜尋人肉果腹。只記得在太陽升起前一定要待在室內！</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Demon_Slayer_Unleashed/BH_DS_Server.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1123\" height=\"129\"></p>\n<p>伺服器目前處於測試階段，但仍歡迎加入！</p>\n<p>DSUnleashed.modded.fun</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;感謝 Bisect 贊助我們的整合包！</p>\n<p>&nbsp;<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fdemon\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Demon_Slayer_Unleashed/BH_DS_PromoCard.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1123\" height=\"174\"></a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><br><span><iframe allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/tROaZb0vGy8?wmode=transparent\" height=\"358\" width=\"638\"></iframe></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>特此感謝各模組開發者的貢獻。</p>\n<p>別忘了前往體驗由 Shadow 開發的水產養殖模組。</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/aquaculture\" rel=\"nofollow\">Aquaculture 2 - 模組 - Minecraft - CurseForge</a></p>",
